---
import { CheckCircle2, XCircle, AlertTriangle } from 'lucide-react';
---

<section class="py-16 sm:py-24 bg-slate-950 border-t border-slate-800 relative overflow-hidden" id="compliance-matrix">
  {/* Background Glow */}
  <div class="absolute top-1/2 left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 w-full max-w-3xl h-64 bg-gold/5 blur-[120px] pointer-events-none"></div>

  <div class="mx-auto max-w-7xl px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 relative z-10">
    <div class="text-center max-w-3xl mx-auto mb-12">
      <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-full border border-gold/30 bg-gold/10 px-4 py-1.5 mb-4">
        <span class="text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-gold">Regulatory Compliance</span>
      </div>
      <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight text-cream sm:text-4xl">
        The Cost of Legacy Architecture
      </h2>
      <p class="mt-4 text-lg text-slate-400">
        With CISA and OMB memory-safety mandates taking effect, relying on non-deterministic C/C++ or legacy ROS2 poses significant procurement risk. ReluLayer™ provides a verifiable safe harbor.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="overflow-x-auto rounded-2xl border border-slate-800 bg-slate-900/50 shadow-2xl backdrop-blur-sm">
      <table class="w-full text-left text-sm text-slate-300">
        <thead class="bg-slate-800/80 text-xs uppercase text-slate-400 border-b border-slate-700">
          <tr>
            <th scope="col" class="px-6 py-5 font-semibold w-1/3">Architectural Standard</th>
            <th scope="col" class="px-6 py-5 font-semibold bg-red-500/5 border-l border-r border-slate-800 w-1/3">
              <div class="flex items-center gap-2 text-red-400">
                <AlertTriangle className="h-4 w-4" />
                Legacy ROS2 / C++
              </div>
            </th>
            <th scope="col" class="px-6 py-5 font-semibold bg-emerald-500/10 border-gold/30 w-1/3">
              <div class="flex items-center gap-2 text-emerald-400">
                <CheckCircle2 className="h-4 w-4" />
                ReluLayer™ (no_std Rust)
              </div>
            </th>
          </tr>
        </thead>
        <tbody class="divide-y divide-slate-800">
          <tr class="hover:bg-slate-800/30 transition-colors">
            <td class="px-6 py-5 font-medium text-cream">CISA Memory-Safety Mandate</td>
            <td class="px-6 py-5 text-red-300 bg-red-500/5 border-l border-r border-slate-800">
              <div class="flex items-start gap-2">
                <XCircle className="h-4 w-4 mt-0.5 shrink-0 text-red-500" />
                <span>Non-Compliant</span>
              </div>
            </td>
            <td class="px-6 py-5 text-emerald-300 bg-emerald-500/5">
              <div class="flex items-start gap-2">
                <CheckCircle2 className="h-4 w-4 mt-0.5 shrink-0 text-emerald-500" />
                <span>100% Compliant</span>
              </div>
            </td>
          </tr>
          <tr class="hover:bg-slate-800/30 transition-colors">
            <td class="px-6 py-5 font-medium text-cream">OMB M-24-10 (Secure Software Development)</td>
            <td class="px-6 py-5 text-red-300 bg-red-500/5 border-l border-r border-slate-800">
              <div class="flex items-start gap-2">
                <AlertTriangle className="h-4 w-4 mt-0.5 shrink-0 text-amber-500" />
                <span>Requires Costly Waivers</span>
              </div>
            </td>
            <td class="px-6 py-5 text-emerald-300 bg-emerald-500/5">
              <div class="flex items-start gap-2">
                <CheckCircle2 className="h-4 w-4 mt-0.5 shrink-0 text-emerald-500" />
                <span>Turnkey SSDF</span>
              </div>
            </td>
          </tr>
          <tr class="hover:bg-slate-800/30 transition-colors">
            <td class="px-6 py-5 font-medium text-cream">Dynamic Heap Allocation (Vulnerability Risk)</td>
            <td class="px-6 py-5 text-red-300 bg-red-500/5 border-l border-r border-slate-800">
              <div class="flex items-start gap-2">
                <XCircle className="h-4 w-4 mt-0.5 shrink-0 text-red-500" />
                <span>High Risk (Memory Leaks / Buffer Overflows)</span>
              </div>
            </td>
            <td class="px-6 py-5 text-emerald-300 bg-emerald-500/5">
              <div class="flex items-start gap-2">
                <CheckCircle2 className="h-4 w-4 mt-0.5 shrink-0 text-emerald-500" />
                <span>Zero Heap (<code>#![no_std]</code> Rust)</span>
              </div>
            </td>
          </tr>
          <tr class="hover:bg-slate-800/30 transition-colors">
            <td class="px-6 py-5 font-medium text-cream">Execution Determinism (Jitter/Latency)</td>
            <td class="px-6 py-5 text-red-300 bg-red-500/5 border-l border-r border-slate-800">
              <div class="flex items-start gap-2">
                <XCircle className="h-4 w-4 mt-0.5 shrink-0 text-red-500" />
                <span>Non-Deterministic</span>
              </div>
            </td>
            <td class="px-6 py-5 text-emerald-300 bg-emerald-500/5">
              <div class="flex items-start gap-2">
                <CheckCircle2 className="h-4 w-4 mt-0.5 shrink-0 text-emerald-500" />
                <span>Mathematically Bounded (0.199 µs WCET)</span>
              </div>
            </td>
          </tr>
          <tr class="hover:bg-slate-800/30 transition-colors">
            <td class="px-6 py-5 font-medium text-cream">Defense Procurement Risk (2027+)</td>
            <td class="px-6 py-5 text-red-300 bg-red-500/5 border-l border-r border-slate-800">
              <div class="flex items-start gap-2">
                <AlertTriangle className="h-4 w-4 mt-0.5 shrink-0 text-red-500" />
                <span class="font-bold">High Risk of Contract Disqualification</span>
              </div>
            </td>
            <td class="px-6 py-5 text-emerald-300 bg-emerald-500/5">
              <div class="flex items-start gap-2">
                <CheckCircle2 className="h-4 w-4 mt-0.5 shrink-0 text-emerald-500" />
                <span class="font-bold text-emerald-400">Zero Liability</span>
              </div>
            </td>
          </tr>
        </tbody>
      </table>
    </div>

    <div class="mt-12 text-center">
      <p class="text-sm text-slate-400 mb-6 font-medium">De-risk your next DoD bid. Schedule your Architecture Compatibility Audit.</p>
      <a href="#sblo-form" class="inline-flex items-center justify-center rounded-lg bg-gold px-8 py-3.5 text-sm font-bold text-slate-950 shadow-gold-glow transition hover:bg-gold-400">
        Request $25k Fixed Diagnostic Audit
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
